; Current text style when $TEXTSTYLE is missing or names no style ([0.8-RT11], work #683).
; Handwritten files (R2018, LF), each with one STYLE record or two:
; mancante.dxf: $TEXTSTYLE = Missing, table with Custom only (arial.ttf, 40=0, 41=1, 50=0);
; senza-standard.dxf: no $TEXTSTYLE, table with Custom only;
; senza-textstyle.dxf: no $TEXTSTYLE, table with Standard (arial.ttf) and Custom.
; Sheet PT11 point 3 (PT4, P15): the current style is Standard, created as in a new drawing
; (arial.ttf, sheet PT11 point 2) when the table lacks it. Standard then equals the one of a
; new session: "text styles:" lists Custom only and "text style:" is absent
; (docs/verifica/rapporto.md). Reading creates Standard as AutoCAD does on opening, not
; an edit: the drawing is not modified and nothing is on the undo stack.
; Saving mancante.dxf and reopening it keeps Custom and the current Standard.
; cambia con #683
OPEN
mancante.dxf
!report
SAVE
mancante-salvato.dxf
OPEN
mancante-salvato.dxf
!report
OPEN
senza-standard.dxf
!report
OPEN
senza-textstyle.dxf
